  "img": "icons/svg/statue.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": "<section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block scrpg-archetype-block-intro\"><p>You are an indomitable and unstoppable force.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Powers/Qualities</div><p>Assign one or more of the dice you rolled at the end of the power source step to any of these powers:</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.hQIArnjTuOBxYoPT]{Signature Vehicle}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.fubw8CJu2mXFZJUD]{Signature Weaponry}</p><p>• Select from Athletic powers category</p><p>• Select from Intellectual powers category</p><p>• Select from Materials powers category</p><p>• Select from Mobility powers category</p><p>• Select from Technological powers category</p><p>Assign any remaining dice to any of these qualities:</p><p>• Select from Physical qualities category</p><p>• Select from Social qualities category</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Abilities</div><p>Gain the following Green ability:</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.0SIacYiyqsFTPovE]{Armored}</li></ul><p>Gain three of these Green abilities of your choice, using at least two different powers:</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.cyHxS1GUExiDEJZV]{Deflect}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.6BYMFdvoejvDBh9P]{Dual Offense}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.vWAHWQ5SsWBfi7vC]{Living Bulwark}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.uPFnUKUH60kAZEHd]{Repair}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.HgvvG5jACSFcG5UI]{Unstoppable Charge}</li></ul></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Principle</div><p>Choose an Expertise principle.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Additional Info</div><p>When determining Health during step 7, you may use a Materials or Technological power instead of an Athletic power or Mental quality.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Personality</div><p>Roll d10, d10 for personality selection.</p></section>"
